      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; gene &lt;i&gt;PPOX&lt;/i&gt; was heterologously expressed into the &lt;i&gt;hemG E. coli&lt;/i&gt; mutant strain lacking the endogenous protoporphyrinogen oxidase enzyme, and was shown to fully complement the mutation |CITS:[8982084]|.</Comment>
