    <DataNode elementId="AT1G03475-MONOMER" textLabel="Coproporphyrinogen-III oxidase 1, chloroplastic" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9LR75" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="475" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; gene &lt;i&gt;HEMF1&lt;/i&gt; was heterologously expressed into the &lt;i&gt;hemF Saccharomyces cerevisiae&lt;/i&gt; mutant strain lacking endogenous coproporphyrinogen III oxidase activity, and was shown to fully complement the mutation |CITS:[SANTANA02]|.</Comment>
