      <Comment source="BioCyc">The reaction stoichiometry has been experimentally determined using aerobic coproporphyrinogen oxidase from the yeast &lt;i&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae&lt;/i&gt; |CITS: [9251002]|. The Enzyme Commission presents the following reaction for EC 1.3.3.3: coproporphyrinogen-III + O2 = protoporphyrinogen-IX + 2 CO2 The reaction listed by the Enzyme Commission differs from the experimentally verified equation. The reaction stoichiometry has been experimentally determined using aerobic coproporphyrinogen oxidase from the yeast|CITS: [9251002]|.</Comment>
